# md1 repository boundaries

md1 is **not** part of readlang / Newt. It is its own product and git repo.

| | |
|---|---|
| **Repo** | https://github.com/nickcurator/md1 |
| **Local path** | `/Users/mykolaantipov/Documents/antipov/md1` |
| **Production** | https://md1.space |
| **Newt / readlang** | https://getnewt.app — separate repo, Drive removed |

## Git

- Work on md1 (editor, `/api/docs`, API tokens, MCP, migrations, settings) → **commit and push only here** (`origin` → `nickcurator/md1`).
- **Never** commit or push md1 code, MCP server, or md1-only Cursor rules to `readlang`.
- When the user says «пуш» in an md1 context → push **md1 only**, unless they explicitly name readlang.

## Deploy

- Vercel project for md1.space (not the readlang/Newt Vercel project).
- Supabase: md1’s own project (not Newt’s DB for new features).
